msgstr "不能偷袭,纯粹竞速"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:330
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Nowhere to hide"
msgstr "无处藏身"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:519
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "One epic round"
msgstr "一场史诗对决"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:456
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "One point, one game"
msgstr "一分定一局"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:179
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Orbit the dying star"
msgstr "环绕垂死恒星"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:481
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Outrun the wasteland"
msgstr "逃离荒原"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:494
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Pure downhill duel"
msgstr "纯粹的下坡对决"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:468
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Race the avalanche"
msgstr "与雪崩赛跑"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:380
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Race through the wasteland"
msgstr "飞驰穿越荒原"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:430
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Serve, rally, win"
msgstr "发球、对攻、取胜"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:239
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Two pilots, one river"
msgstr "两名飞行员,一条河"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:342
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your kills are their problem"
msgstr "你击杀的人,都成了他们的麻烦"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:521
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "1 long round — 20-piece igloo, all enemies from the start, temperature drops slowly. Epic arctic endurance."
msgstr "单个长回合——20块冰砖的冰屋,敌人从一开始就全部出现,温度缓慢下降。史诗级北极耐力考验。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:399
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "3-minute race in permanent darkness with fog bursts. Pure reflexes — most overtakes wins. Headlights only visibility."
msgstr "在永久黑夜中进行3分钟比赛,不时有浓雾袭来。纯粹考验反应——超车最多者获胜。只有车头灯提供视野。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:508
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Arctic construction race — jump on floating ice blocks to build your igloo. Steal your opponent's blocks for a 2-piece swing. Best of 5 rounds with polar bears, crabs, geese, and clams."
msgstr "北极建造竞赛——跳上漂浮的冰块来建造你的冰屋。抢走对手的冰块,一抢一送相差两块。五轮三胜制,途中有北极熊、螃蟹、鹅和蛤蜊。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:370
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Blitz Space Invaders — instant alien drops, easier combos, 5 waves of pure chaos from the start."
msgstr "闪电版太空侵略者——外星人瞬间下降,连击更容易,从一开始就是5波纯粹的混乱。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:357
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Classic co-op Space Invaders — two cannons fighting the same alien waves. No alien drop. Survive together or fall together."
msgstr "经典合作版太空侵略者——两门大炮对抗同一批外星人。外星人不会下坠。同生共死。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:213
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Cooperative Breakout with two paddles — one at the top, one at the bottom. Work together to destroy all blocks before running out of lives."
msgstr "双挡板合作打砖块——一块在顶部,一块在底部。在生命耗尽之前,齐心协力消灭所有砖块。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:416
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Daylight sprint — no weather changes, no fuel drain, just speed. 90 seconds to score maximum overtakes."
msgstr "白昼冲刺——没有天气变化,没有燃料消耗,只拼速度。90秒内争取超车次数最多。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:458
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every point wins a game — no 15-30-40, no deuce. First to 6 games takes the set. Pure pressure."
msgstr "每得一分就赢下一局——没有15-30-40,也没有平分。先赢6局者拿下一盘。纯粹的压力。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:197
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Fight through a field of floating asteroids that block missiles and kill on contact. Use the debris for cover — or watch it destroy you. First to 7 wins."
msgstr "在漂浮的小行星带中战斗,小行星会挡住导弹,碰到就会致命。利用碎片作掩护——否则就被它摧毁。先得7分者获胜。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:483
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Infinite descent — the avalanche never stops accelerating. Last skier standing wins. Pure survival."
msgstr "无尽下坡——雪崩不断加速,永不停歇。最后留下的滑雪选手获胜。纯粹的生存。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:165
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Newtonian space combat — thrust, rotate, and fire missiles in open vacuum. Wraparound edges, hyperspace warp (20% death chance), first to 7 wins."
msgstr "牛顿式太空战——在开阔的真空中推进、旋转并发射导弹。边缘环绕,超空间跳跃(20%几率死亡),先得7分者获胜。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:496
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No avalanche, no items — just trees, rocks, and gates. Fastest time down the mountain wins."
msgstr "没有雪崩,没有道具——只有树木、岩石和旗门。下山用时最短者获胜。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:574
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No timer — first to 5 goals wins. Puck speed increases with each goal scored. The pressure builds every time the net shakes."
msgstr "没有计时——先进5球者获胜。每进一球,冰球速度就会加快。每次球网晃动,压力都在增加。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:560
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "One period of 3 minutes — faster puck, higher tackle success rate. Pure intensity from start to finish."
msgstr "一节3分钟——冰球更快,抢断成功率更高。从头到尾都是纯粹的激烈对抗。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:181
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Orbital combat around a central gravity star. Use gravity slingshots, but fly too close and the star kills you. First to 7 wins."
msgstr "围绕中央引力恒星的轨道战斗。可以利用引力弹弓,但飞得太近就会被恒星杀死。先得7分者获胜。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:128
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Pong reimagined as cyberpunk arcade — neon glow, CRT scanlines, synth audio. First to 11 points (win by 2). Ball speeds up on each rally."
msgstr "将乒乓重塑为赛博朋克街机——霓虹光效、CRT扫描线、合成器音效。先得11分者获胜(需领先2分)。每次对攻球速都会加快。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:382
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Pseudo-3D racing duel through day, snow, fog, and night. Overtake AI cars and your opponent, manage fuel, draft in slipstreams. Best of 3 days."
msgstr "伪3D赛车对决,穿越白天、雪地、浓雾和黑夜。超越AI车辆和你的对手,管理燃料,利用尾流跟车。三天两胜制。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:534
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Pure construction race — no block stealing allowed. First to complete the igloo wins. Fair and square."
msgstr "纯粹的建造竞赛——禁止抢夺冰块。率先建成冰屋者获胜。公平公正。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:445
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Quick tennis match — first to 3 games wins. Same gameplay, shorter format. No tiebreak needed."
msgstr "快速网球比赛——先赢3局者获胜。玩法相同,赛制更短。无需抢七。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:140
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Race across a grid arena leaving a glowing trail behind you. Hit a trail or the wall and you're out. Trap your opponent to win."
msgstr "在网格竞技场中飞驰,身后留下一道发光的轨迹。撞上轨迹或墙壁就出局。困住对手即可获胜。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:344
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Split-screen Space Invaders — aliens you destroy fall on your opponent as reinforcements. Combos send extra. 10 waves of escalating chaos."
msgstr "分屏版太空侵略者——你消灭的外星人会作为援军落到对手那边。连击会送出更多。10波不断升级的混乱。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:470
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Top-down alpine descent through toxic wastelands — dodge mutant trees, clear slalom gates, outrun the avalanche. Best of 3 runs with rising difficulty."
msgstr "俯视视角的高山滑降,穿越有毒荒原——躲避变异树木,通过回转旗门,逃离雪崩。三轮两胜制,难度逐轮上升。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:281
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Top-down boxing — close punches score more. Push-and-pull until KO or decision by points. Best of 3 rounds."
msgstr "俯视视角拳击——近距离出拳得分更高。拉扯对攻,直到击倒获胜或按点数判定。三回合两胜制。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:546
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Top-down ice hockey in a cyberpunk arena — control your field player, shoot, tackle, and score while your AI goalie defends. 3 periods of 2 minutes."
msgstr "网球竞技场的自上而下的冰球——在AI守门员防守时,控制你的场上球员,射击,击球,和得分. 3期2分钟."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:432
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Top-down tennis duel — automatic hitting, shot angle depends on ball contact position. Full set with tiebreak at 6-6. Deuce, advantage, the works."
msgstr "俯视视角网球对决——自动击球,击球角度取决于球的接触位置。完整一盘,6-6时进行抢七。平分、占先,一应俱全。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:225
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Versus Breakout battle — each player defends a brick castle with a king inside. Deflect or catch the fireball to smash your opponent's walls. Last king standing wins."
msgstr "对战打砖块——每位玩家守护一座内有国王的砖砌城堡。挡开或接住火球,砸毁对手的城墙。最后留下的国王获胜。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:332
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Western duel in open field — no obstacle, full horizontal movement. Dodge freely in your half. First to 10. Best of 3 rounds."
msgstr "开阔场地的西部决斗——没有障碍物,可完全横向移动。在你的半场内自由闪避。先得10分者获胜。三回合两胜制。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:319
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Western duel with a stagecoach rolling across the arena. Time your shots around the moving obstacle. First to 10. Best of 3 rounds."
msgstr "西部决斗,一辆驿站马车在场地中穿行。把握好时机,绕开移动的障碍物射击。先得 10 分者胜,三局两胜。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:306
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Western duel with bouncing bullets — fire at angles to bypass the wall. Bullets ricochet once off ceiling/floor. First to 10. Best of 3 rounds."
msgstr "西部决斗,子弹会反弹——以不同角度射击以绕过墙。子弹碰到天花板/floor 会反弹一次。先得 10 分者胜,三局两胜。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:293
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Western duel — two gunslingers and a cactus. Dodge bullets you can see coming. First to 10. Best of 3 rounds."
msgstr "西部决斗——两名枪手和一株仙人掌。躲开你能看见飞来的子弹。先得 10 分者胜,三局两胜。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/announcer.ex:198
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{p1} and %{p2} cleared %{game} with %{p1_score} points"
msgstr "%{p1}和%{p2}以 %{p1_score} 分通关了%{game}"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/announcer.ex:184
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
